    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当我们处在艰难时刻，除了咬牙坚持，我们还可以祈祷。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> &nbsp;祈祷是一项古老的人类活动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> &nbsp;Coco亲身经历祈祷对人体能量的改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> &nbsp;祈祷其实也是向宇宙下订单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> &nbsp;从灵媒和科学角度解释为什么有的人能通过祈祷进入出神状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">16:53</a> 祈祷是精神上的肌肉练习，人人都可以做</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1138">18:58</a> 手把手教大家为自己做一篇祈祷文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">18:47</a> 谁来祈祷：要报自己的名字</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1173">19:33</a> 向谁祈祷：自己相信存在的一个更高存在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> 一个关键点：搞清楚“想要”和“需要”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 负面的祈祷，即诅咒，会把低频能量吸回自己身上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1761">29:21</a> 应该祈祷内在状态的改善而不是具体的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">34:50</a> 离珠和Coco各自提供私人祈祷文供参考</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><h1><span>Down to the River to Pray - The Petersens (LIVE)</span></h1><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;The Prayer-Céline Dion, Andrea Bocelli&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播介绍：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Coco Ma</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>博士/电影制片人/灵媒/灵性能量疗愈师</span></p><span></span><p><span>现居澳大利亚，擅长与灵体沟通以及能量疗愈，提供感情、事业、健康方面的多维度解读，帮助案主更好地完成生命蓝图中的课题，以有限精力真诚为需要帮助的朋友提供解读疗愈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信号：cocohealing</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：yezicoco@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：灵媒CocoMa</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>段离珠</span></strong></p><span>