    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本想做灵媒知识科普，没想到越聊越严肃，说的都是Coco和离珠的肺腑之言，想找我们咨询的朋友建议认真听一听，这一期也是Coco收到指导灵讯息让我们必须出的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a> 开宗明义：什么是灵媒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> 灵媒“调频”的方式有哪些</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="498">08:18</a> 灵媒常说的“指导灵“是什么东东</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="843">14:03</a> 护法和指导灵不是一回事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1137">18:57</a> 对于“吸渣”体质，星盘能看到啥，灵媒又怎么处理</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你准备寻求玄学帮助，我们有一些建议给你——</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> 到底要不要测试你的咨询师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a> 尊重自己的感受，不舒服立刻喊停</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> 找和自己三观相近的咨询师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1881">31:21</a> 咨询师的年龄很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1968">32:48</a> 玄学建议只供参考，人生还得自己做决定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2326">38:46</a>：被铁断“命不好”、“孤独终老”怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2523">42:03</a> “邪师”的几个特征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2666">44:26</a> 你遇到的人，是你内心的显化</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Tony DeSare - Autumn Leaves</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播介绍：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Coco Ma</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>博士/电影制片人/灵媒/灵性能量疗愈师</span></p><span></span><p><span>现居澳大利亚，擅长与灵体沟通以及能量疗愈，提供感情、事业、健康方面的多维度解读，帮助案主更好地完成生命蓝图中的课题，以有限精力真诚为需要帮助的朋友提供解读疗愈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信号：cocohealing</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：yezicoco@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：灵媒CocoMa</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>段离珠</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>现居北京，七政四余占星师，自由作者编剧，也是</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61d7b44055c5f4da4ef2177d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61d7b44055c5f4da4ef2177d"><span>天风姤呛</span></a><span>播主。</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：离珠占星</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：段离珠</span></p><span></span><p><span>想找我看盘的朋友，建议先看看我的</span><a href="https://www.ireadstars.com/" data-url="https://www.ireadstars.com/"><span>官网</span></a><span>（用电脑打开内容更丰富），仔细阅读</span><a href="https://www.ireadstars.com/post/%E7%A6%BB%E7%8F%A0%E5%8D%A0%E6%98%9F-%E7%9C%8B%E7%9B%98%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B" data-url="https://www.ireadstars.com/post/%E7%A6%BB%E7%8F%A0%E5%8D%A0%E6%98%9F-%E7%9C%8B%E7%9B%98%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B"><span>预约流程</span></a><span>，觉得我的一对一咨询体系适合你再加我的微信，感谢尊重我的规则和流程，平等交流，不用叫我老师。</span></p>]]></description>
