    <title>中元节奇谈和脑洞：“鬼”不过是执念</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ed4a2ae490c5dee5b83c73</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64ed4a2ae490c5dee5b83c73</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Aug 2023 01:30:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>中元节也是双鱼座满月，大家这两天先别出去浪啦，待在家里放松躺平，做点冥想用意念清理孽缘，拿水晶晒晒月光，听听播客也不错哦（有部分内容没通过，重新剪辑上传了呜呜）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a>农历七月十五是佛教和道教的传统节日</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="234">3:54</a>从墨西哥亡灵节的源头，想起“印第安人是商朝人”的脑洞假说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">7:00</a>鬼是纯阴之气，纯阴对应水气，农历七月水气萌生，群鬼出门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">8:30</a>黑色代表负能量，尽量少穿黑色衣服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="598">9:58</a>甲骨文鬼字的含义：1.戴面具跳大神的人 2.人所归为鬼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="658">10:58</a>灵媒对鬼的理解：意识残留，存在于不同的维度，能量并不高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a>生前执念太强，去世后留下意识残留，成为“鬼”</span></p><span></span><p><span>中元节各种禁忌解释—</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="926">15:26</a>为什么不要挂风铃？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1007">16:47</a>为什么不要喊名字？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1083">18:03</a>为什么不要晒衣服？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1166">19:26</a>为什么不要玩笔仙灵摆？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1249">20:49</a>一切都是显化：内心恐惧显化恐惧，内心有爱显化爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1266">21:06</a>中元节适逢双鱼座满月：建议躺平，别纠结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1389">23:09</a>满月可以做两件事：1.净化水晶 2.了断牵绊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1452">24:12</a>分享一个用意念切断孽缘的技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM： MY IMMORTAL——EVANESCENCE</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播介绍：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Coco Ma</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>博士/电影制片人/灵媒/灵性能量疗愈师</span></p><span></span><p><span>现居澳大利亚，擅长与灵体沟通以及能量疗愈，提供感情、事业、健康方面的多维度解读，帮助案主更好地完成生命蓝图中的课题，以有限精力真诚为需要帮助的朋友提供解读疗愈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信号：cocohealing</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：yezicoco@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：灵媒CocoMa</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>段离珠</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>现居北京，七政四余占星师，自由作者编剧，也是</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61d7b44055c5f4da4ef2177d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61d7b44055c5f4da4ef2177d"><span>天风姤呛</span></a><span>播主。</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：离珠占星</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：段离珠</span></p><span></span><p><span>想找我看盘的朋友，建议先看看我的</span><a href="https://www.ireadstars.com/" data-url="https://www.ireadstars.com/"><span>官网</span></a><span>（用电脑打开内容更丰富），仔细阅读</span><a href="https://www.ireadstars.com/post/%E7%A6%BB%E7%8F%A0%E5%8D%A0%E6%98%9F-%E7%9C%8B%E7%9B%98%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B" data-url="https://www.ireadstars.com/post/%E7%A6%BB%E7%8F%A0%E5%8D%A0%E6%98%9F-%E7%9C%8B%E7%9B%98%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B"><span>预约流程</span></a><span>，觉得我的一对一咨询体系适合你再加我的微信，感谢尊重我的规则和流程，平等交流，不用叫我老师。</span></p>]]></description>
