    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Aug 2023 09:08:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>寺庙景点那一集很受欢迎，我们决定把这个聊成系列，这一集除了讲述景点的能量感受，也会分享占星和神秘学干货，还有一则爱信不信的顶流八卦，观点仅代表主播本人，节目内容仅供娱乐，谢谢大家支持。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> </span><strong><span>北京白云观拜太岁：跪拜中感觉到能量保护膜裹身上</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a> 2018年犯太岁拿了两个符（那一年也是所有人的转折，段离珠写过一篇</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7FSCNdRf_zJbOjKW3nVRGg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7FSCNdRf_zJbOjKW3nVRGg"><span>占星分析</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> 占星科普：太岁是太岁，岁星是木星</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">15:03</a> 2023年太岁星是火星，火灾爆炸事故频繁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a> </span><strong><span>五台山五爷庙：有求必应</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">20:23</a> 某顶流第一次出事那年，其母曾到五台山许愿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 关于这位顶流的真实生日，星盘界也有一个八卦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1549">25:49</a> </span><strong><span>伦敦威斯敏斯特大教堂：在里面看见了宇宙星辰</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1642">27:22</a> 对西方天使能量和东方菩萨能量的不同感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a></span><strong><span> 大英博物馆埃及馆：被猫木乃伊触发，看见了身为埃及疗愈师的前世</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a>为什么那么多人的前世来自古埃及？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2506">41:46</a>在博物馆买文创纪念品会把相应能量带回来吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2624">43:44</a> 二手店买的Vintage古着要先做能量清理</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：harry &amp; hermione ( harry potter and the half-blood prince ) nicholas hooper</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播介绍：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Coco Ma</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>博士/电影制片人/灵媒/灵性能量疗愈师</span></p><span></span><p><span>现居澳大利亚，擅长与灵体沟通以及能量疗愈，提供感情、事业、健康方面的多维度解读，帮助案主更好地完成生命蓝图中的课题，以有限精力真诚为需要帮助的朋友提供解读疗愈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信号：cocohealing</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：yezicoco@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：灵媒CocoMa</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>段离珠</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>现居北京，七政四余占星师，自由作者编剧，也是</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61d7b44055c5f4da4ef2177d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61d7b44055c5f4da4ef2177d"><span>天风姤呛</span></a><span>播主。</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：离珠占星</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：段离珠</span></p><span></span><p><span>想找我看盘的朋友，建议先看看我的</span><a href="https://www.ireadstars.com/" data-url="https://www.ireadstars.com/"><span>官网</span></a><span>（用电脑打开内容更丰富），仔细阅读</span><a href="https://www.ireadstars.com/post/%E7%A6%BB%E7%8F%A0%E5%8D%A0%E6%98%9F-%E7%9C%8B%E7%9B%98%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B" data-url="https://www.ireadstars.com/post/%E7%A6%BB%E7%8F%A0%E5%8D%A0%E6%98%9F-%E7%9C%8B%E7%9B%98%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B"><span>预约流程</span></a><span>，觉得我的一对一咨询体系适合你再加我的微信，感谢尊重我的规则和流程，平等交流，不用叫我老师。</span></p>]]></description>
